Q-Non Funtional testing
-> testing performanace, load and security, Responce of the app, Behaviour etc
-Load testing
-> Load testing checks how the application performs under the expected number of users/load.
->If an application normally has 1,000 users, we test it with around 1,000 users to check response time and stability.

-Stress Testing
->Stress testing checks how the application behaves when the load is increased beyond its expected limit.
->If the application is designed for 1,000 users, we gradually increase it to 2,000, 5,000, etc. to find the breaking point.

